title: 'nBootstrap: Nonparametric Bootstrap Confidence Intervals'
version: 0.1.0
abstract: 'Nonparametric bootstrap helpers: percentile, bias-corrected, and bias-corrected
  and accelerated confidence intervals from a matrix of draws, and nonparametric bootstrap
  and jackknife half-vectorized covariance matrices computed in C++. PCCI(), BCCI(),
  and BCaCI() are exported; the internal workers are copied by other projects.'
